[h2]Build 0.9.32[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Copy and paste conveyor arm settings.[/b] Copy settings on one arm, then Paste settings onto another - or select several arms and paste onto all of them at once. Copies the mode (Loader, Feeder, Mover), a Mover's "What to move" filter, Feeder priority, Return leftovers, and whether the arm puts down straight across or round a corner from its gripper. Each arm keeps its own facing.
[/list]
